portrait-cards for Herdr

mods/spaces-cards/main.js is derived from the `spaces` mod shipped with the
Herdr app (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, defaults/mods/), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-Herdr.txt). Changes: replaced the list
render with a wrapping grid of horizontal cards (cardRows() / card()), added a
28x28 round "New space" button, removed the machine and IP text, restyled the
active card to a transparent fill with a 4px blue bar on the top edge, and
pinned idle / hover card fills to #1c1c1c / #202020.

mods/agents-cards/main.js is derived from the `agents` mod shipped with Herdr
under the same license. Changes: replaced the list render with a wrapping grid
of horizontal cards, added a 28x28 round sort button (Priority / Grouped by
space popup), kept setAgentOrder() fed by the card list, restyled the active
card to a transparent fill with a 4px blue bar on the bottom edge, and pinned
idle / hover card fills as above.

Icons referenced at mods/workspace-chrome/*.svg are Herdr's shipped assets and
are not included in this repository.

layouts/portrait-cards.json records cloned_from: main 0.1.15 (a clone of
Herdr's shipped `main` layout).

The App-generated gpui-kit.d.ts and jsconfig.json files were left out of the
shared mod folders; Herdr recreates them on start.
